{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/01/25/2089735/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(川後の)ひなちゃんに、ブログのタイトル\nつくってって言ったら、んー...って\n考えてっから、そお言ったので、\nそれがタイトルになりました＼(^o^)／笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"テスト勉強真っ只中です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"がんばってコーヒー飲んでみるのに、\nなぜだかすごく眠いよ～(つω+｀)うー、にがい...。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさん、さゆにゃんに\nパワーをくださゆにゃんっ★"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"えいえいおーっ∩^ω^∩！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よし！頑張りますっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うむ！o(｀・_・´)o"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/01/25/2089735/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"パソコンは相方ですっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"学生のみなさん、いっしょに\n頑張りましょう(*^ω^*)♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は、短くってごめんなさい(>_<)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/01/25/2089735/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また明日っ(*＾ω＾*)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/01/25/2089735/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"○  さゆにゃんの今一番の願い事とかなんかありますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＊  健康、、、ですかねっ꒰｡^ω^`;꒱！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなが幸せでいてくれれば！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"○  野球部ってどんなイメージ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＊  吹奏楽で、高校野球の応援に\n行っていたので\n私にとっては、すごく青春って\nイメージがあります(*^_^*)○°"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一生懸命でまっすぐで、\n素敵だなって思います ＊＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"○  歌手、女優、バラドル、もしどれか1つしかなれないとしたらどれを選ぶかな?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＊    迷わず、女優さんです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Bicycleのときの中島監督さんが\n歌もダンスも演技って言ってて\nなるほど～と思いました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"○  最近、お腹が痛くなるほど笑っちゃったことってある？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＊   ギャグ漫画日和です(丿^ω^ヽ)！\n笑いすぎて、それから３日間くらい\n思い出し笑いが止まらなかったです（笑）\nつぅめをつぅめで～終わらせない\nつぅめ～に～つぅきつぅつぅめ～♪\nってやつ！（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/01/25/2089735/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/01/25/2089735/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/01/25/2089735/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆにゃんヽ(｡･ω･｡)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/01/25/2089735/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/01/25/2089735/0008.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}